		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Black jackal, crocodile skull for a head. Purgatory hounds, hunt undead.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 10, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +2 (1d6 + wrench spirit), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Magical Being</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Wrench Spirit</strong>. Esobok tears spirit free from body. Undead of LV 2 or lower are destroyed. Otherwise, CHA 12+ or stunned for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
